ssic Virchowian criterion of cellular pathology. Though those searching for a biological basis of schizophrenia far outnumber those undertaking psychological approaches, Arieti supports the minority view. He believes schizophrenia is an unrealistic way to represent both the self and the world and praises psychiatrist Adolf Meyer for stressing the importance of psychological factors in the etiology of schizophrenia.","matchedBy":"infobox_book:high","confidence":"high","attribution":{"label":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interpretation_of_Schizophrenia","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"},"infobox":{"author":"Silvano Arieti","language":"English","subject":"Psychology }}"}},"sources":[{"id":"source-award-record-national-book-awards-nonfiction-wikipedia-national-book-award-for-nonfiction","label":"Wikipedia: National Book Award for Nonfiction","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Book_Award_for_Nonfiction","accessedAt":"2026-08-20T21:35:58.016Z","confidence":"secondary","field":"award","note":"Official archive URL: https://www.nationalbook.org/national-book-awards/search/ Imported table: National Book Award for Nonfiction winners and finalists, 2020–2029"},{"id":"source-open-library-interpretation-of-schizophrenia-silvano-arieti","label":"Open Library metadata for Interpretation of Schizophrenia","url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL6174838M","accessedAt":"2026-05-12T23:10:04.457Z","confidence":"catalog","field":"book"},{"id":"source-imprint-normalization","label":"Curated raw-publisher to imprint normalization","url":"","accessedAt":"2026-08-20T21:35:56.163Z","confidence":"manual","field":"publisher","note":"Curated mappings from raw catalog publisher strings to explicit imprint and parent-publisher records. Used by scripts/normalize-imprints.ts to generate sources/enrichment/imprints.normalized.json."},{"id":"source-wikipedia-interpretation-of-schizophrenia-silvano-arieti","label":"Wikipedi